# OpenStreetMap — free Nominatim (name search) + Overpass (nearby)
# No API key is required. The static site calls these public endpoints directly.
# Follow usage policies:
# - Nominatim: https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/
# - Keep request volume modest (about 1 req/sec for public Nominatim).
#
# Optional public endpoint overrides (defaults work for local/dev and Pages):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OSM_NOMINATIM_URL=https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OSM_OVERPASS_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter

# Vehicle lookup — resolves make/model from a registration number.
#
# This must point at the proxy in workers/vehicle-lookup, NOT at a vendor.
# The site is a static export, so anything here ships inside the JS bundle;
# a vendor key placed here would be readable by anyone and is billed per call.
# See workers/vehicle-lookup/README.md for deployment.
#
# Leave unset and the app still works: it decodes the state/RTO from the number
# and asks for the RC to fill in make and model.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VEHICLE_API_URL=https://vehicle-lookup.your-subdomain.workers.dev
